{"version":1,"key":"card:639","content":{"id":639,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"08f677f9-6a9f-4d4f-a4bf-8b67ff0499ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先要明白两个概念："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"142c9d2f-5ba1-419a-b0e4-c8c811af9b66","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f934b4a3-f519-4cd4-b8a2-c2882056f536","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4bd179b7-0979-427d-bc6c-ff2811aa6d68","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"click"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件的 300ms 延迟"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bae5678e-a219-4a18-b0e8-419d7c8e2a03","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在早期互联网，当时的网站都是为 PC 端设计了，在移动端中，用户往往需要通过双击来放大页面，而为了区分用户的单击还是双击，在第一点击屏幕时（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"touchend"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）并不会立即触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"click"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，而是会等待 300ms，在 300ms 内如果用户再次点击，则会触发双击缩放，如果没有则会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"click"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4c0f13db-7067-4316-a880-80d9325c1887","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f1835fca-ebdc-498e-a4a7-b13a6b7a7272","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"点击穿透"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dfa1f3e8-9dbc-4b2d-b862-6356e7d33873","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设存在一个模态窗口，当你点击关闭按钮时，为了立即关闭会监听 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"touchend"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件将窗口隐藏，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"click"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件并没有发生，等到 300 ms 后，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"click"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件触发，但是此时上层的模态窗口已经不存在了，点击事件就触发到了下层的元素，这就是点击穿透"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6ec443a2-2cf1-4c64-89a6-3aeaa499d44a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因此点击事件的 300ms 延迟是因，而点击穿透是果，只要解决了 300ms 毫秒延迟，点击穿透的问题就迎刃而解了。由于随着移动设备的普及，大部分网站已转向移动端优先，所以双击放大的需求大大减少，而点击延迟也极大地影响用户体验。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fb29fc03-824f-49fe-9cdf-ed13752de03f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么如何解决 300ms 的延迟呢："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"5e7ea851-fcc8-497e-a29c-021a8ce77c89","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ad259eac-8e31-447e-92cc-0621e65e9e9c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"95944cf9-0e62-4438-b60b-ddc9912f54e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设置 Viewport Meta 标签"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fab0bc7a-35f4-43cf-90bd-c3042c074fa2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现代浏览器已经约定，如果页面被明确标记为移动端友好（即不需要缩放），那么浏览器就可以禁用双击缩放，取消 300ms 的延迟，这个属性就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"user-scalable=no"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，现代浏览器的首选方案"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"de2565e6-c82f-4513-985f-413dd086ea61","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5be2ea94-5020-4a0d-9302-3fa9e268f91e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">","collabId":"d2f1b0c2-141c-4b49-8b79-3732a1648e8c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5f622d53-b18e-4e6c-b809-db1b0ce58aa8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0b7f82f9-668d-40a9-9c0e-5e644bdb7750","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 JavaScript 库"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8a169352-ab01-4b55-98a5-0b145a139997","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"viewport"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方案普及之前，大家都会使用一个 Fastclick.js 的库，它会在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"touchend"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件上注册一个监听器，当 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"touchend"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 触发时，它会创建一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"click"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，并且 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dispatch"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个事件，并且阻止 300ms 后的原生 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"click"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e2fd5317-c19a-43ca-9c12-11ef51c99fbf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在现代浏览器中已无必要，甚至可能和浏览器的原生优化冲突，且库已多年不维护"}]}]}]}],"tags":["前端/技巧","浏览器/踩坑","踩坑/浏览器"],"createTime":1762866059803,"updateTime":1765546726904,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1765546726904}}